{
  "job_B14.29_20251003_114308": {
    "chunk_text": "o\u00f0\u00f0e forena forlicge, sy he emscyldig wi\u00f0 me \u00feam \u00f0e \u00feeof scolde, buton he & ic wylle, \u00fe\u00e6t eal \u00feeodscype, gehadode & l\u00e6wede, f\u00e6stlice Eadgares lage healde, \u00fee ealle men For \u00f0am \u00fee ealle biscopas secga\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t hit swy\u00fee deop wi\u00f0 God to betanne, \u00fe\u00e6t man a\u00f0as o\u00f0\u00f0e wedd & eac hy us fur\u00f0or l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t we sceolon eallan magene & eallon myhton \u00feone ecan mildan God inlice & eac we beoda\u00f0 on Godes \u00e6lmihtiges naman & on ealra his haligra, \u00fe\u00e6t nan man swa dyrstig ne sy, & gyf hit hwa gedon h\u00e6bbe, beo he utlah wi\u00f0 God & amansumod fram eallum Cristendome & wi\u00f0 & gyt we fur\u00f0or mania\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man Sunnand\u00e6ges freols mid eallum m\u00e6gene healde & weor\u00f0ige fram & ealle men, earme & eadige, heora cyrcan secean & for heora synnum \u00feingian & \u00e6lc beboden f\u00e6stan.",
